# Every SSR proof builds here before running. It was never committed only
# because each dispatch happened to `rm -rf` it first — and the one time that
# was forgotten, oxlint linted the BUILD OUTPUT and reported a phantom
# `no-undef` on `process` in a bundle. Ignored here and in `.oxlintrc.json`,
# so neither git nor lint depends on anyone remembering.
.ssr-tmp

